{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3*60 (three times sixty) is a pin-ball platformer with limited controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place the ball:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/BallPlaceGIF.gif?t=1745515426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then drop the ball and collect the three green dots in each level:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/BallDropGIF.gif?t=1745515426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The catch is, once the ball is dropped it can no-longer be moved left-to-right. However you can jump infinitely:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/extras/BallGoalsGIF.gif?t=1745515426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the environment to control your movement and reach your goals.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720330?t=1745515426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720330?t=1745515426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/f4171ad8f566c6a231b41c53f5c3f3b10e0fb45a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745515426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720330/f4171ad8f566c6a231b41c53f5c3f3b10e0fb45a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745515426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3*60 (three times sixty) is a pin-ball platformer with limited controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place the ball:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt